conceal, obscure, clip, make transparent or require scrolling through the
document, hovering, opening a menu, or visiting an About page to discover it.
A hyperlink is encouraged but not required. No logo image is required.

You may replace or relocate the supplied attribution component only if the
result still satisfies this section, or as permitted by a separate written
